          "biography": "Andrei Valerievich Fedyaev (\u0410\u043d\u0434\u0440\u0435\u0439 \u0412\u0430\u043b\u0435\u0440\u044c\u0435\u0432\u0438\u0447 \u0424\u0435\u0434\u044f\u0435\u0432) is a Russian cosmonaut. He was a military pilot prior to retiring from Air Force in 2013, and was selected as a cosmonaut in 2012. \r\n\r\nISS-69 expedition will be Fedyaev's first spaceflight.",
